Typos like yoyo goal chek now exit 2 instead of 0. All four cases from #982 now exit 2, and the printed text, the stream it goes to and its bytes are unchanged. It's committed as 53a6276d ("Part of #982"). Build, cargo test, clippy with -D warnings and fmt --check all pass.

Before and after, using the built binary (fresh git repo, </dev/null, stdout and stderr compared byte for byte):

